{"id":"H3263","lemma":"יְעוּץ","transliteration":"yeuts","sayIt":"ye-UTS","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jeuz","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.10;\nson of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hodesh (H2321);\nbrother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821), Abitub (H0036) and Elpaal (H0508)\n§ Jeuz = \"counsellor\"\nhead of a house of Benjamin","glosses":["jeuz"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jeuz","kjv":"And Jeuz"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:10","note":"Jeuz, Shachia, and Mirmah. These were his sons, heads of fathers’ households.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0036","lemma":"אֲבִיטוּב","transliteration":"avituv","gloss":"Abitub"},{"id":"H0508","lemma":"אֶלְפַּ֫עַל","transliteration":"elpaal","gloss":"Elpaal"},{"id":"H2321","lemma":"חֹ֫דֶשׁ","transliteration":"chodesh","gloss":"Hodesh"},{"id":"H3103","lemma":"יוֹבָב","transliteration":"yovav","gloss":"Jobab"},{"id":"H7842","lemma":"שַׁחֲרַ֫יִם","transliteration":"shacharayim","gloss":"Shaharaim"},{"id":"H6644","lemma":"צִבְיָא","transliteration":"tsivya","gloss":"Zibia"},{"id":"H4331","lemma":"מֵישָׁא","transliteration":"mesah","gloss":"Mesha"},{"id":"H4445","lemma":"מַלְכָּם","transliteration":"malkam","gloss":"Malcam"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}